  - benchmark evaluation
  - reproducibility
  - industrial visual inspection
abstract: >-
  Code, frozen results and audit trail for a benchmark-and-evaluation study of
  neural architecture search and score fusion in unsupervised industrial anomaly
  detection. Contains the diagnosed pipeline, the experiments behind every number
  in the paper, the frozen outputs, and the scripts that regenerate every table
  and figure. Includes an analysis showing that the standard single-category
  comparison on MVTec-AD resolves 2.98 AUROC points while the margin the field
  contests is 0.5 points.
